  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>这是我的第二张空岛地图。这张地图独一无二，你不再出生在那种无聊的旧式空岛上，而是出生在苍翠花园。你将不得不努力利用苍白木板，并且必须与<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">嘎吱怪<span style=\"color:#fff\">战斗。欢迎在评论区展示你的建筑作品！</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0b1afb95-b0fe-4b39-899e-2daa267dfd48.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"824\" height=\"718\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">玩得开心 :)</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>也来看看我的其他地图吧！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/forest-and-fields-adventure-map\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">森林与原野</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/seven-survival-islands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">七个生存岛屿</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/the-mysterious-island\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神秘之岛</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>J.M.J.</strong></span></p>",
